# OS packages needed to build and install this plugin.
# install.sh maps these names per distro; this file is the human-readable list.

git
curl
ca-certificates
python3
gcc
make

# C library headers (CGO)
#   Debian/Ubuntu: libc6-dev
#   RHEL/Fedora:   glibc-devel
#   Alpine:        musl-dev
#   Arch:          glibc (base-devel)

# Go toolchain >= 1.22
#   Debian/Ubuntu: golang-go (only if new enough) or https://go.dev/dl/
#   RHEL/Fedora:   golang
#   Alpine:        go
#   Arch:          go

# Optional
#   systemd — restart cli-proxy-api after install
#   sudo    — write /opt/cli-proxy-api when not running as root
